Conversion/repackaging notice

RapidAI converted official PaddleOCR model representations to ONNX. ktb.scanner
preserves those ONNX bytes and packages them with an explicit inference
configuration and dictionary for the browser SDK. The TAR/YAML packaging is a
downstream adaptation, not an unmodified official Paddle model archive.
The model identity is checked against the distribution hashes; the original
training/conversion pipeline has not been independently reproduced.

The current RapidOCR MODEL_LICENSES table lists its default v6/classifier files
and is not used as a blanket license grant for these v5 weights. The separate
official v5 model cards above provide the model-specific licensing evidence.
No dataset, sample image, other model or trademark grant is implied.
